             description '<Information><Description><Version>4.0</Version><IsMainModel>1</IsMainModel><KeepParameterValues>False</KeepParameterValues><LibraryPath>Bond Graph\2D\Se-2.emx</LibraryPath><TimeStamp>2007-9-25 12:7:0</TimeStamp><AllowLibraryUpdate>True</AllowLibraryUpdate><Configuration><struct><member><name>DocumentationMask</name><value><struct></struct></value></member></struct></Configuration></Description><Attributes><GlobalRelations></GlobalRelations></Attributes></Information>';
